  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.1",
      "verse_number": 1,
      "en": "This rule I made in all My works, saith Jehovih: When I separate the people, the good go away out from amongst the evil.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.2",
      "verse_number": 2,
      "en": "Even as I drew the Israelites out of Egupt.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.3",
      "verse_number": 3,
      "en": "And, whoso go out, prosper in My hand; I make them an everlasting people.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.4",
      "verse_number": 4,
      "en": "But those that remain, go down to destruction; and they become unknown upon the earth.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.5",
      "verse_number": 5,
      "en": "Their great men are forgotten, and their wisest men lose caste in the histories of a thousand years.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.6",
      "verse_number": 6,
      "en": "Behold, these things I had made known unto the generations of the earth.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.7",
      "verse_number": 7,
      "en": "Now, when I separated the Faithists and the Uzians, in the kosmon era, I sent angels, warning them. I said unto them:",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.8",
      "verse_number": 8,
      "en": "Flatter not yourselves that man is all wisdom; I say unto you, I am with the righteous; might shall not triumph through wrong-doing. Behold, a judgment shall come upon this people.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.9",
      "verse_number": 9,
      "en": "When I begin to call them, My chosen shall come and found My kingdom; and they shall come faster and faster every year.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.10",
      "verse_number": 10,
      "en": "And the Uzians shall fall into iniquity, more and more every year.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.11",
      "verse_number": 11,
      "en": "And, now, behold what hath been!",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.12",
      "verse_number": 12,
      "en": "The prince of devils came upon the Uzians, saying:",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.13",
      "verse_number": 13,
      "en": "Think not that I come to send peace on earth; I come not to send peace, but a sword.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.14",
      "verse_number": 14,
      "en": "I come to set man at variance against his father, and a daughter against her mother.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.15",
      "verse_number": 15,
      "en": "Now, therefore, when My angels went in behalf of My kingdom, behold, the prince of devils did invade the places of the ungodly.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.16",
      "verse_number": 16,
      "en": "And, whoso received My angels, and practiced righteousness, were fallen upon by the emissaries of the prince of devils, and unmercifully treated with curses and tortures.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.17",
      "verse_number": 17,
      "en": "But I called the righteous hence, and they built unto Me My kingdom.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.18",
      "verse_number": 18,
      "en": "And I said unto the Uzians: Let this be a testimony unto you of the power of the Almighty;",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.19",
      "verse_number": 19,
      "en": "Ye go about building ships of war, and harbors for defense, with torpedoes, and with all manner of wicked inventions;",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.20",
      "verse_number": 20,
      "en": "But I say unto you, this nation, this government and this people shall not be attacked in the places ye build.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.21",
      "verse_number": 21,
      "en": "It is within.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.22",
      "verse_number": 22,
      "en": "For I will draw away the righteous, and none but rogues shall accept your great offices.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.23",
      "verse_number": 23,
      "en": "And this matter shall grow upon you in the way of evil, declining in virtue more and more every year.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.24",
      "verse_number": 24,
      "en": "Look, therefore, at your grade; judge ye the words of the Almighty.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.25",
      "verse_number": 25,
      "en": "My hands fashioned the signs of the times.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.26",
      "verse_number": 26,
      "en": "As the hirer this day hireth one man to watch another, even so shall it come unto you in the great offices of your government.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.27",
      "verse_number": 27,
      "en": "By force and by might, ye shall hope to overcome the prince of devils, but ye shall fail",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jehovih-kingdom.25.28",
      "verse_number": 28,
      "en": "And, in proportion as ye go down in corruption, even so shall the Faithists go away into My kingdoms.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    }
  ],
  "preamble_source": null
}
